@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tasco-nouns`
IMPORT `tasco-p0-definitions`
IMPORT `tasco-ch1-contract`
IMPORT `tasco-ch1-exclusions`
IMPORT `tasco-ch2-physical-damage`
IMPORT `tasco-ch6-additional-clauses`

-- The answer on a claim for physical damage to the vehicle, in three layers kept apart:
--   1. is the event covered? the vehicle and the contract (opening paragraph, Điều 1-3), the
--      perils of Điều 14.1, the exclusions of Điều 11 and 15, less those an additional clause
--      buys back (BS03, BS04, BS05, BS11, BS12, BS13), plus those a clause adds (BS05, BS08,
--      BS10);
--   2. how much? Điều 18 (partial or total loss), the deductible (Điều 19, or BS03's / BS04's),
--      the reduction of Điều 13, the costs of Điều 14.2, the cap of the sum insured;
--   3. the duties and deadlines are in tasco-ch1-duties.l4 and are not part of this answer.
-- Nothing here is new law: every step cites the provision it applies. The order of the steps in
-- layer 2 is not stated by the rules (forks F22-F25).
-- No quotations: each provision is quoted where it is encoded.

§ `The answer on a physical damage claim`

-- An exclusion point that an additional clause held, and applicable, takes away.
@ref Chương VI, BS03 (src:1187-1196), BS04 (src:1197-1212), BS05 (src:1214-1230), BS11 (src:1323-1345), BS12 (src:1347-1355), BS13 (src:1357-1371)
GIVEN `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
      `the point` IS AN `An exclusion point`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`an additional clause buys back` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts` `the point` MEANS
        (`the point` EQUALS `art 15.2 engine damage in flood water` AND `BS03 — buys back the flood-water exclusion` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts`)
    OR  (`the point` EQUALS `art 15.4 theft of parts`               AND `BS04 — covers the theft of parts` `the cover` `the facts`)
    OR  (`the point` EQUALS `art 11.8 outside Vietnam`              AND `BS05 — buys back the outside-Vietnam exclusion` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts`)
    OR  (`the point` EQUALS `art 15.8 added equipment`              AND `BS11 — buys back the added-equipment exclusion` `the cover` `the facts`
                                                                    AND NOT `the loss`'s `exclusion facts`'s `loss caused by such added equipment`)
    OR  (`the point` EQUALS `art 11.9 war, terrorism, riot or explosives` AND `BS12 — buys back the riot exclusion` `the cover` `the loss`)
    OR  (`the point` EQUALS `art 15.9 own special equipment`        AND `BS13 — buys back the special-equipment exclusion` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts`)

-- The exclusion points a held clause adds.
@ref Chương VI, BS05(c) (src:1229-1230), BS08(d) (src:1296), BS10(c) (src:1320-1321), BS12(b) (src:1351), BS13(b) (src:1363-1371)
GIVEN `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An exclusion point`
`the exclusions the additional clauses add` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts` MEANS
    `the points that fire among`
        (LIST (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `BS05 theft in a country named on the certificate`, `fires` IS `the cover holds` `BS05 outside Vietnam` `the cover` AND `BS05 — theft abroad` `the loss`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `BS08 the maker's or assembler's technical fault`, `fires` IS `the cover holds` `BS08 temporary circulation` `the cover` AND `the facts`'s `loss from the maker's or assembler's technical fault`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `BS10 no instructor present, or no auxiliary brake`, `fires` IS `the cover holds` `BS10 driving-school vehicle` `the cover` AND `BS10 — no instructor or no auxiliary brake` `the facts`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `BS12 bombs or explosive devices`, `fires` IS `the cover holds` `BS12 vandalism and riot` `the cover` AND `the loss`'s `circumstances`'s `bombs, mines or explosive devices`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `BS13 unsafe vehicle, unlicensed operator, or rules broken`, `fires` IS `the cover holds` `BS13 special equipment` `the cover` AND `the loss`'s `exclusion facts`'s `loss caused by the operation of the vehicle's own special equipment` AND `BS13 — one of its exceptions applies` `the loss` `the facts`))

@ref Rules, Điều 11, 15 (src:611-666, 775-818), with Chương VI
GIVEN `the contract` IS A `The contract`
      `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An exclusion point`
`the exclusions that remain on the physical damage claim` `the contract` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts` MEANS
    append (filter (GIVEN p YIELD NOT `an additional clause buys back` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts` p)
                   (`art 11 and 15 — the exclusions that apply to the physical damage claim` `the loss` (`the contract`'s `vehicle`'s `what it carries`)))
           (`the exclusions the additional clauses add` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts`)

-- Điều 13: the reduction rate, the highest of those that apply.
@ref Rules, Điều 13 (src:673-740)
GIVEN `the contract` IS A `The contract`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`art 13 — the reduction on the physical damage claim` `the contract` `the loss` MEANS
    `art 13.2 — the rate applied`
        (`art 13.1 — the reductions that apply` (`the loss`'s `circumstances`) (`the loss`'s `conduct after the loss`) (`the contract`'s `vehicle`'s `what it carries`))

-- Layer 2 for a partial loss: Điều 18.1 before the deductible (with depreciation unless BS01),
-- BS11's payment for a lost item of added equipment where BS11 takes 15.8 away, the deductible
-- (BS03's where BS03 took 15.2 away, BS04's for a theft of parts, else Điều 19.3), Điều 13's
-- reduction, the costs of Điều 14.2, the cap.
@ref Rules, Điều 14.2, 18.1, 19, 13 (src:758-769, 847-927, 965-984, 673-740); BS01, BS03, BS04, BS11
GIVEN `the contract` IS A `The contract`
      `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount on a partial loss` `the contract` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts` MEANS
    `art 14 — capped at the sum insured` `the cover`
        (    (1 MINUS `art 13 — the reduction on the physical damage claim` `the contract` `the loss`)
                 TIMES `art 19.2 — the loss after the deductible` `before the deductible` `the deductible`
         PLUS `art 14.2 — the costs payable besides the compensation` `the cover` (`the loss`'s `damage`))
    WHERE
        `the months of use` MEANS
            `the months of use of` (`the contract`'s `vehicle`) `at a contract concluded on` (`the contract`'s `date the contract was concluded`)
        `the added item` MEANS
            IF   `an additional clause buys back` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts` `art 15.8 added equipment`
            THEN `BS11 — the payment for the lost item` `the facts`
            ELSE 0
        `before the deductible` MEANS
                `art 18.1 — the partial loss before the deductible` `the cover` (`the loss`'s `damage`) `the months of use`
                    (`the contract`'s `vehicle`'s `used for business`) (`BS01 — depreciation applies under` `the cover`)
            PLUS `the added item`
        `the deductible` MEANS
            BRANCH IF `BS03 — buys back the flood-water exclusion` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts`
                      THEN `BS03 — the deductible on` `before the deductible`
                   IF `the loss`'s `cause of the damage` EQUALS `theft or robbery of parts of the vehicle`
                      THEN `BS04 — the deductible on` `before the deductible`
                   OTHERWISE `art 19.3 — the deductible per loss` `the cover`

-- Layer 2 for a total loss: Điều 18.2.3, less a wreck the owner keeps (18.3.2), Điều 13's
-- reduction, the costs of Điều 14.2, the cap. No deductible (Điều 19.1 charges it on partial
-- losses) and no ratio for under-insurance (18.1.2(a) is for partial losses).
@ref Rules, Điều 18.2-18.3, 14.2, 13 (src:929-960, 758-769, 673-740)
GIVEN `the contract` IS A `The contract`
      `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount on a total loss` `the contract` `the cover` `the loss` MEANS
    `art 14 — capped at the sum insured` `the cover`
        (    (1 MINUS `art 13 — the reduction on the physical damage claim` `the contract` `the loss`)
                 TIMES max 0 (    `art 18.2.3 — the total loss payable` `the cover` (`the loss`'s `damage`)
                             MINUS `art 18.3.2 — the deduction where the owner keeps the wreck` (`the loss`'s `damage`))
         PLUS `art 14.2 — the costs payable besides the compensation` `the cover` (`the loss`'s `damage`))

-- The whole answer.
@ref Rules, opening paragraph, Điều 1-3, 11, 13-19, Chương VI
GIVEN `the contract` IS A `The contract`
      `the cover` IS A `The physical damage cover`
      `the loss` IS A `A loss to the vehicle`
      `the facts` IS A `The facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A `The answer on a claim`
`the answer on the physical damage claim` `the contract` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the rules apply to` (`the contract`'s `vehicle`)
            THEN `outside the cover` "opening paragraph: the rules apply to cars, tractors and trailers drawn by them"
        IF NOT `the contract has effect on` (`the loss`'s `date of the loss`) `for` `the contract`
            THEN `outside the cover` "art 1-3: the contract had no effect on the day of the loss"
        IF `a theft of parts` AND `BS04 — covers the theft of parts` `the cover` `the facts`
            THEN `the answer once covered`
        IF `a theft of parts`
            THEN `excluded` (LIST `art 15.4 theft of parts`)
        IF NOT `art 14.1 — the loss is within the insured perils` `the loss`
            THEN `outside the cover` "art 14.1: the damage was not caused by a peril it names"
        OTHERWISE `the answer once covered`
    WHERE
        `a theft of parts` MEANS `the loss`'s `cause of the damage` EQUALS `theft or robbery of parts of the vehicle`
        `the exclusions` MEANS `the exclusions that remain on the physical damage claim` `the contract` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts`
        `the answer once covered` MEANS
            BRANCH
                IF NOT (`the exclusions` EQUALS EMPTY)
                    THEN `excluded` `the exclusions`
                IF `the loss`'s `cause of the damage` EQUALS `theft or robbery of the whole vehicle`
                    THEN IF   `art 18.2.2 — a stolen vehicle may be paid as a total loss` (`the loss`'s `damage`)
                         THEN `payable` (`the amount on a total loss` `the contract` `the cover` `the loss`)
                         ELSE `not yet payable` "art 18.2.2: the police have not concluded by suspending the investigation or prosecution"
                IF `art 18.2.1 — a total loss by damage` (`the loss`'s `damage`)
                    THEN `payable` (`the amount on a total loss` `the contract` `the cover` `the loss`)
                OTHERWISE `payable` (`the amount on a partial loss` `the contract` `the cover` `the loss` `the facts`)
